# The Indexing and Dissemination of Curriculum Guides for the Arts and Humanities; Volume I. Final Report.

**Authors:** Geibel, Grace Ann

## Abstract
This volume presents a discussion of the research methods, results and findings, and conclusions of a study to develop a computer generated index of course guides for Related Arts and Humanities Programs that include music and are currently operating in secondary schools throughout the country. The computer-generated index is contained in Volume II of the report. Appendices present a Format of Course Descriptions, Correspondence, and High Schools included in the Index. (DB)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED054151

